# Personal data must never be committed.
#
# The skill keeps your resume, career context, and past mock-interview sessions
# in a workspace outside this repo (~/job-interview-prep/ by default, or it
# reuses ~/job-application-answers/profile/). These rules are a second line of
# defense in case anything lands here by accident.

profile/
sessions/
answers/
intros/
workspace/

# Resume / personal documents in any form
*resume*
*résumé*
*cv*
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc

# Common accidents (personal mock transcripts / drafts landing at the repo root)
context.md
my-*.md
draft*.md
mock-*.md
session-*.md
*.local.md

.DS_Store
